<h2>After registration</h2>

<p>Registration confirms by email. When the delegate portal opens, delegates
sign in with that email address to update details, book a stand, request B2B
meetings and download documents.</p>

<p>Journalists apply through <a href="/media/">media accreditation</a>.</p>

